---
// One captured proof replayed through a load balancer: per-instance caches against one shared store.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 400 388" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="dp-cr-t dp-cr-d">
  <title id="dp-cr-t">Replay of one captured proof against four API instances</title>
  <desc id="dp-cr-d">
    Top, each of four instances has its own jti cache. The real request reached instance 1, so its cache
    has the jti and it rejects the replay. Instances 2, 3 and 4 have never seen the jti and accept the
    replay once each: three replays get in. Bottom, the four instances share one store. The real request
    wrote the jti there, and every replay, whichever instance it reaches, is rejected.
  </desc>

  <text x="4" y="20" font-size="17" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">A cache per instance</text>
  {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => (
    <g>
      <rect x={4 + i * 100} y="32" width="92" height="38" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" />
      <text x={50 + i * 100} y="57" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">API {i + 1}</text>
      <rect
        x={14 + i * 100} y="80" width="72" height="30" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5"
        style={i === 0 ? 'fill: var(--viz-store-soft); stroke: var(--viz-store)' : 'fill: var(--viz-surface); stroke: var(--viz-stroke)'}
      />
      <text x={50 + i * 100} y="100" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style={`fill: var(${i === 0 ? '--viz-ink' : '--viz-muted'})`}>{i === 0 ? 'jti seen' : 'empty'}</text>
      <text x={50 + i * 100} y="136" font-size="16" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" style={`fill: var(${i === 0 ? '--viz-bad' : '--viz-ok'})`}>{i === 0 ? '✗ rejected' : '✓ accepted'}</text>
    </g>
  ))}
  <text x="4" y="164" font-size="15" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">the replay gets in 3 times: once per instance that missed it</text>

  <line x1="4" y1="184" x2="396" y2="184" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 5" style="stroke: var(--viz-stroke)" />

  <text x="4" y="212" font-size="17" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">One shared store</text>
  {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => (
    <g>
      <rect x={4 + i * 100} y="224" width="92" height="38" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" />
      <text x={50 + i * 100} y="249" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">API {i + 1}</text>
      <path d={`M${50 + i * 100} 262 L200 300`} stroke-width="1.5" style="stroke: var(--viz-store)" />
      <text x={50 + i * 100} y="284" font-size="16" font-weight="600" text-anchor={i < 2 ? 'end' : 'start'} dx={i < 2 ? -6 : 6} style="fill: var(--viz-bad)">✗</text>
    </g>
  ))}
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="304" rx="70" ry="8" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-store-soft); stroke: var(--viz-store)" />
  <path d="M130 304 L130 336 A70 8 0 0 0 270 336 L270 304" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-store-soft); stroke: var(--viz-store)" />
  <text x="200" y="330" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">jti seen</text>
  <text x="4" y="376" font-size="15" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">SET jti NX EX 65: the first write wins, the rest fail</text>
</svg>
